\title{api.potsdam: Pushover Notifications for Free Appointments at the API Potsdam}
\description{
Checks the public online booking calendar (samedi) of the outpatient clinic of the 'Akademie fuer Psychotherapie und Interventionsforschung' (API) in Potsdam for free appointments of a given appointment type and health insurance and sends a 'Pushover' notification as soon as appointments are available.
}
